# Papa Ulap - 88.7 Radyo Karimlan (Tawong Lipod Wind-Engkanto FM DJ)
# Voice: Warm, musical, snappy Filipino community FM DJ broadcasting from above the mango canopy.
# Syncs: 2-phase daily schedule (before_noon / after_noon) + live {Global_RadioTimeCheck} + folklore trivia + commercials + world news.
# Rules: Zero em-dashes. Zero ellipses. Zero [pause] tags. Zero [b] tags. Zero faded blue color walls.

label EventBroadcast
set {Variation} = range(1,4).pick_random()
if {Variation} == 1.0:
	PapaUlap: Timecheck on 88.7 Radyo Karimlan, {Global_RadioTimeCheck}! Fresh barangay bulletin riding the wind!
elif {Variation} == 2.0:
	PapaUlap: Turn that dial up, mga kapitbahay! {Global_RadioTimeCheck} news flash straight from above the roofs!
else:
	PapaUlap: Papa Ulap breaking in at {Global_RadioTimeCheck} with a live street advisory!
PapaUlap: {Global_RadioEventName}! {Global_EventRumorText}
set {Variation} = range(1,4).pick_random()
if {Variation} == 1.0:
	PapaUlap: Stock smart and mind your tags, suki! Keep it breezy behind that counter!
elif {Variation} == 2.0:
	PapaUlap: You heard it first on 88.7! Stay sharp and keep your coin jar ready!
else:
	PapaUlap: That is the word on the wind, mga ka-tindahan! Back to the music!
[signal arg="radio_event_revealed"]
[end_timeline]

label VisitorBroadcast
set {Variation} = range(1,4).pick_random()
if {Variation} == 1.0:
	PapaUlap: 88.7 Street Watch at {Global_RadioTimeCheck}! Just spotted {Global_RadioVisitorName} heading your way!
elif {Variation} == 2.0:
	PapaUlap: Heads up from the clouds, suki! {Global_RadioVisitorName} is walking down your lane!
else:
	PapaUlap: Rooftop radar on 88.7 Radyo Karimlan! Looks like {Global_RadioVisitorName} is stopping by!
PapaUlap: {Global_RadioVisitorHint}
[signal arg="radio_visitor_revealed"]
[end_timeline]

label Chatter
if {Global_RadioEclipse}:
	set {Variation} = range(1,4).pick_random()
	if {Variation} == 1.0:
		PapaUlap: {Global_RadioTimeCheck} under a quiet eclipse, mga kapitbahay. Even the wind is whispering up here.
		PapaUlap: Zero market rushes on the radar. Just soft static and steady shelves!
	elif {Variation} == 2.0:
		PapaUlap: Papa Ulap checking in at {Global_RadioTimeCheck}. Strange hush over every roof in Karimlan!
		PapaUlap: Take it easy behind the counter while the moon keeps the street quiet, suki.
	else:
		PapaUlap: Testing, one, two! Signal is crystal clear at {Global_RadioTimeCheck}, though the road below is hushed.
		PapaUlap: No big bulletins riding the breeze. Just you, me, and the hum of your cooler!
	[end_timeline]

set {Variation} = range(1,17).pick_random()
if {Variation} == 1.0:
	# Cross-Web News #1: Triangle A (Kap / Ana)
	if {Flag_KapSubCandy}:
		PapaUlap: Street note at {Global_RadioTimeCheck}! Folks passing the acacia report zero smoke and a strong scent of mint candy!
		PapaUlap: Somebody behind a wooden counter is working quiet miracles, mga kapitbahay!
	elif {Flag_AnaFlewAgain} or {Flag_BuboyTrustedErrand}:
		PapaUlap: Word along the road says a hardworking nanay finally got a break from her stove!
		PapaUlap: Clear breeze above the rooftops, mga suki! Good hearing laughter up here!
	else:
		PapaUlap: Timecheck on 88.7, {Global_RadioTimeCheck}! Smell of garlic rice drifting three blocks up from the karinderya!
		PapaUlap: Don't forget to eat behind that register, ka-tindahan!
elif {Variation} == 2.0:
	# Cross-Web News #2: Triangle B (Brahim / Danilo / Rosalyn)
	if {Flag_BrahimLanternWard} or {Flag_DaniloTracedTether}:
		PapaUlap: Traffic note at {Global_RadioTimeCheck}! Drivers rounding the highway bend say the cold fog finally lifted by the waiting shed!
		PapaUlap: Keep your porch bulbs warm and your neighbors close, mga kapitbahay!
	else:
		PapaUlap: 88.7 Folklore Minute! Ever feel a sudden cool gust on a windless street?
		PapaUlap: Bicol elders call us Tawong Lipod, the hidden folk of the breeze. Relax, suki, I'm just checking your awning!
elif {Variation} == 3.0:
	# Cross-Web News #3: Pair 1 (Lolo Pilo / T.K.)
	if {Flag_PiloWagerSet} or {Flag_TKRematchAccepted}:
		PapaUlap: Half-court sports update at {Global_RadioTimeCheck}! Sipa is officially back in Karimlan!
		PapaUlap: One tiny sixty-eight legend and one seven-foot rookie keeping that lead washer airborne!
	else:
		PapaUlap: 88.7 Folklore Minute! Lost on a familiar trail and circling the same mango tree?
		PapaUlap: Old folks swear by baliktad ang damit, wearing your shirt inside out! Works even better than phone GPS!
elif {Variation} == 4.0:
	# Cross-Web News #4: Pair 2 (Rodel / Sarimanok)
	if {Flag_RodelShelteredBird} or {Flag_SmkHonoredRodel}:
		PapaUlap: Creek bank report at {Global_RadioTimeCheck}! Not a single wrapper in the bamboo roots, and kids are calling Dayu-dayu across the bridge!
		PapaUlap: Even a famous painted rooster knows good manners by the water!
	else:
		PapaUlap: 88.7 Folklore Minute! Passing a termite mound or creek bamboo? Say Tabi-tabi po or Dayu-dayu!
		PapaUlap: Polite words cost zero centavos, suki, and save you from mysterious knotted shoelaces!
elif {Variation} == 5.0:
	# Folklore Trivia #1: Tawong Lipod
	PapaUlap: Listeners keep asking where my broadcast booth sits! Easy, suki, look up at the tallest mango cloud!
	PapaUlap: A Tawong Lipod needs zero steel towers to ride 88.7 Radyo Karimlan!
elif {Variation} == 6.0:
	# Folklore Trivia #2: Tikbalang Sunshower
	PapaUlap: Karimlan Almanac at {Global_RadioTimeCheck}! Ever wonder why folks grin when rain falls under bright sun?
	PapaUlap: May kinakasal na tikbalang! Just a joyful old proverb, though our tall jogger blushes every time I say it!
elif {Variation} == 7.0:
	# Folklore Trivia #3: Albularyo Alay Ethics
	PapaUlap: Karimlan Almanac on 88.7! True folk healers never hang a price list outside their porch!
	PapaUlap: In old tradition, healing is paid only in humble alay, never fixed cash fees!
elif {Variation} == 8.0:
	# Folklore Trivia #4: Biringan & Black Rice
	PapaUlap: Caller just asked if Biringan gets 88.7 reception! Haha, our signal reaches places missing from every map!
	PapaUlap: Just remember the old rule, suki: if a glowing city offers you black rice, politely pass!
elif {Variation} == 9.0:
	# Folklore Trivia #5: Duwende & Sweets
	PapaUlap: Quick trivia riding the breeze! Old stories say mound spirits remember kindness ten times longer than gold!
	PapaUlap: A single sweet candy left respectfully buys luck money cannot touch!
elif {Variation} == 10.0:
	# Folklore Trivia #6: Maranao Sarimanok Fish Emblem
	PapaUlap: Karimlan Almanac at {Global_RadioTimeCheck}! Notice how traditional Sarimanok carvings always hold a fish in their beak or talons?
	PapaUlap: Maranao elders honor it as a bridge of abundance, not just a shiny mural!
elif {Variation} == 11.0:
	# Time-of-Day Block #1 (Before Noon vs After Noon)
	if {Global_TimeOfDayPhase} == "before_noon":
		PapaUlap: Magandang umaga, mga ka-tindahan! Timecheck is {Global_RadioTimeCheck}, shutters up and coffee steaming!
		PapaUlap: Roosters are clocking out and Uncle Mario's crate route is warming up!
	else:
		PapaUlap: Good vibes rolling past noon! Timecheck is {Global_RadioTimeCheck} on 88.7 Radyo Karimlan!
		PapaUlap: Breeze is picking up over the half-court, prime merienda stretch ahead!
elif {Variation} == 12.0:
	# Time-of-Day Block #2
	if {Global_TimeOfDayPhase} == "before_noon":
		PapaUlap: {Global_RadioTimeCheck} on your counter radio! First sweep of the broom, first clink of coins!
		PapaUlap: Keep those front jars shining, suki, early regulars love a neat counter!
	else:
		PapaUlap: {Global_RadioTimeCheck} check-in from above the trees! Shadows are stretching across the main road!
		PapaUlap: Porch bulbs will be clicking on soon, mga kapitbahay. Stay cozy behind the wood!
elif {Variation} == 13.0:
	# Time-of-Day Block #3
	if {Global_TimeOfDayPhase} == "before_noon":
		PapaUlap: Breeze check at {Global_RadioTimeCheck}! Cool air off the creek and zero traffic at the tricycle stand!
		PapaUlap: Fine stretch to organize your stock before the rush hits, boss!
	else:
		PapaUlap: Afternoon groove on 88.7 at {Global_RadioTimeCheck}! Smells like toasted garlic and fried snacks down the lane!
		PapaUlap: Keep that fridge door shut tight, suki! I can feel your power bill sweating from up here!
elif {Variation} == 14.0:
	PapaUlap: Friendly reminder from Papa Ulap at {Global_RadioTimeCheck}: stretch your shoulders behind that counter!
	PapaUlap: Your Lola used to tap her foot to 88.7 while counting change, suki!
elif {Variation} == 15.0:
	PapaUlap: Saw Uncle Mario's tricycle zipping down the highway! Man drives like the wind, and I know a thing about wind!
	PapaUlap: Stay tuned to 88.7 Radyo Karimlan!
else:
	PapaUlap: Shoutout to whoever burned dried leaves by the creek! Smoke floated straight through my cloud booth!
	PapaUlap: Still sounding smooth at {Global_RadioTimeCheck}, mga kapitbahay!
[end_timeline]

label CommercialBreak
set {Variation} = range(1,7).pick_random()
if {Variation} == 1.0:
	PapaUlap: Kopimo! Wake up before the rooster does! Timecheck {Global_RadioTimeCheck}, back after these messages!
elif {Variation} == 2.0:
	PapaUlap: Craving Argentita? Open a tin, cook garlic rice, instant fiesta! Papa Ulap returns shortly!
elif {Variation} == 3.0:
	PapaUlap: Mentor Candy! Cool enough to make a kapre put down his smoke! Stay tuned to 88.7!
elif {Variation} == 4.0:
	PapaUlap: Uncle Mario's Express Restock! Fast crates, questionable brakes! 88.7 Radyo Karimlan is right back!
elif {Variation} == 5.0:
	PapaUlap: Cenchuree Tuna! Silver fish so fresh even a Litao stops to stare! Commercial break, suki!
else:
	PapaUlap: Ice-cold Kokaloka! Best cure for a hot tricycle ride! Papa Ulap returns in a breeze at {Global_RadioTimeCheck}!
[end_timeline]
